{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.46, "text": "In this town, everyone must choose between two pills on their 16th birthday."}, {"start": 4.9, "end": 7.08, "text": "The gold pill makes you rich for life."}, {"start": 7.52, "end": 10.76, "text": "But the black pill reveals the biggest secret in our city."}, {"start": 11.2, "end": 13.6, "text": "And once you choose, there's no going back."}, {"start": 14.34, "end": 17.28, "text": "My name is Lucas, and tomorrow I turn 16."}, {"start": 17.76, "end": 21.52, "text": "I live in the poorest part of town, where families can barely afford food."}, {"start": 21.92, "end": 24.8, "text": "But above us, the rich live in floating mansions"}, {"start": 24.8, "end": 28.12, "text": "with swimming pools, helicopters, and unlimited money."}, {"start": 28.12, "end": 31.28, "text": "And every single one of them took the gold pill."}, {"start": 31.92, "end": 33.14, "text": "My mom works in a factory."}, {"start": 33.6, "end": 37.5, "text": "Every night, she tells me, Lucas, promise me you'll choose gold."}, {"start": 38.06, "end": 42.02, "text": "But five years ago, my older sister disappeared on her 16th birthday."}, {"start": 42.36, "end": 43.84, "text": "The government said she ran away."}, {"start": 44.24, "end": 45.5, "text": "I never believed them."}, {"start": 45.98, "end": 48.1, "text": "The next morning, a black limousine arrives."}, {"start": 48.68, "end": 51.0, "text": "Two guards take me to the pill selection center."}, {"start": 51.46, "end": 53.42, "text": "Inside, hundreds of kids are waiting."}, {"start": 53.88, "end": 56.04, "text": "I watch my best friend step onto the stage."}, {"start": 56.04, "end": 57.9, "text": "He swallows the gold pill."}, {"start": 58.74, "end": 61.48, "text": "Suddenly, his clothes transform into an expensive suit."}, {"start": 61.92, "end": 63.4, "text": "A giant screen flashes."}, {"start": 64.08, "end": 64.56, "text": "New balance!"}, {"start": 64.96, "end": 66.14, "text": "Ten million dollars!"}, {"start": 66.78, "end": 67.56, "text": "Everyone cheers."}, {"start": 68.14, "end": 71.42, "text": "A golden elevator opens, taking him to the luxury district."}, {"start": 71.96, "end": 73.14, "text": "Ten million dollars?"}, {"start": 73.46, "end": 75.2, "text": "Just for swallowing one pill?"}, {"start": 75.76, "end": 77.0, "text": "Then, it's my turn."}, {"start": 77.44, "end": 80.18, "text": "An official places two glowing pills in front of me."}, {"start": 80.64, "end": 82.94, "text": "Gold gives you everything you've ever wanted."}, {"start": 83.3, "end": 84.46, "text": "He points to the black pill."}, {"start": 84.46, "end": 87.18, "text": "But black means you'll never be rich."}, {"start": 87.78, "end": 88.64, "text": "I reach for gold."}, {"start": 89.1, "end": 90.72, "text": "But suddenly, I notice something."}, {"start": 91.34, "end": 93.08, "text": "Behind the official is a locked door."}, {"start": 93.6, "end": 95.62, "text": "Someone slides a piece of paper underneath it."}, {"start": 95.86, "end": 96.48, "text": "I pick it up."}, {"start": 96.84, "end": 99.38, "text": "It says, Lucas, don't take gold."}, {"start": 99.8, "end": 100.8, "text": "Trust me, Ruby."}, {"start": 101.54, "end": 101.84, "text": "Ruby?"}, {"start": 102.3, "end": 103.42, "text": "That's my missing sister!"}, {"start": 103.8, "end": 104.36, "text": "She's alive?"}, {"start": 104.92, "end": 105.92, "text": "I stare at the pills."}, {"start": 106.46, "end": 108.78, "text": "One could save my family from poverty forever."}, {"start": 109.24, "end": 111.02, "text": "The other might help me find Ruby."}, {"start": 111.46, "end": 113.4, "text": "The official shouts, make your choice!"}, {"start": 113.4, "end": 115.4, "text": "I only have ten seconds left."}, {"start": 115.88, "end": 116.6, "text": "What should I do, guys?"}, {"start": 117.12, "end": 119.32, "text": "Should I take the black pill or the gold pill?"}, {"start": 119.8, "end": 120.8, "text": "Vote in the poll below!"}, {"start": 121.24, "end": 122.84, "text": "Whichever pill gets the most votes,"}, {"start": 123.22, "end": 124.8, "text": "that's the one I'll take in part two."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.38}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "everyone", "s": 1.12, "e": 1.36}, {"w": "must", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.7}, {"w": "choose", "s": 1.7, "e": 2.06}, {"w": "between", "s": 2.06, "e": 2.42}, {"w": "two", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.8}, {"w": "pills", "s": 2.8, "e": 3.12}, {"w": "on", "s": 3.12, "e": 3.38}, {"w": "their", "s": 3.38, "e": 3.52}, {"w": "16th", "s": 3.52, "e": 4.1}, {"w": "birthday.", "s": 4.1, "e": 4.46}, {"w": "The", "s": 4.9, "e": 4.98}, {"w": "gold", "s": 4.98, "e": 5.34}, {"w": "pill", "s": 5.34, "e": 5.62}, {"w": "makes", "s": 5.62, "e": 5.98}, {"w": "you", "s": 5.98, "e": 6.18}, {"w": "rich", "s": 6.18, "e": 6.44}, {"w": "for", "s": 6.44, "e": 6.74}, {"w": "life.", "s": 6.74, "e": 7.08}, {"w": "But", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.72, "e": 7.86}, {"w": "black", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.16}, {"w": "pill", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.5}, {"w": "reveals", "s": 8.5, "e": 8.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.9, "e": 9.2}, {"w": "biggest", "s": 9.2, "e": 9.58}, {"w": "secret", "s": 9.58, "e": 10.06}, {"w": "in", "s": 10.06, "e": 10.34}, {"w": "our", "s": 10.34, "e": 10.46}, {"w": "city.", "s": 10.46, "e": 10.76}, {"w": "And", "s": 11.2, "e": 11.32}, {"w": "once", "s": 11.32, "e": 11.46}, {"w": "you", "s": 11.46, "e": 11.66}, {"w": "choose,", "s": 11.66, "e": 12.08}, {"w": "there's", "s": 12.5, "e": 12.76}, {"w": "no", "s": 12.76, "e": 13.0}, {"w": "going", "s": 13.0, "e": 13.28}, {"w": "back.", "s": 13.28, "e": 13.6}, {"w": "My", "s": 14.34, "e": 14.5}, {"w": "name", "s": 14.5, "e": 14.64}, {"w": "is", "s": 14.64, "e": 14.88}, {"w": "Lucas,", "s": 14.88, "e": 15.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 15.42, "e": 15.62}, {"w": "tomorrow", "s": 15.62, "e": 15.96}, {"w": "I", "s": 15.96, "e": 16.48}, {"w": "turn", "s": 16.48, "e": 16.7}, {"w": "16.",